KONOHAGAKURE — NARA CLAN INTELLIGENCE-SHARING POLICY

The Nara clan is renowned for its strategists and for its custodianship of the Nara medicinal forest and its shadow techniques.

Provisions:
- Nara strategists support the Jonin Commander's staff in mission planning and battlefield command (see Nara Shikaku, jonin commander of note).
- The clan maintains the deer-park medicinal herb reserve; harvest and use of restricted medicinal materials are logged with the Medical Corps.
- Shadow Imitation and related techniques are clan-taught and clan-restricted.
- Intelligence produced by Nara analysts is shared upward to the Hokage's office; lateral sharing follows need-to-know.

The Nara tradition of pairing with the Yamanaka and Akimichi clans (Ino-Shika-Cho) is maintained across generations.
Maintained by the Nara clan head.
